# Build context exclusions.
#
# Two jobs. The first is speed: this repo carries node_modules, a Python venv
# and a multi-gigabyte data directory, none of which belong in a build context.
# The second matters more — nothing here may ever be baked into an image. The
# data directory holds the live SQLite database, logged-in browser profiles,
# private resumes and application evidence, and an image is a shareable
# artifact. Browser state reaches a container through a volume at run time or
# not at all.

# ── Never bake these in ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/api/data/
apps/api/logs/
data/
logs/
# ...but the repository-root data/ also holds two seed files that are tracked in
# git and are source, not runtime state: the resume corpus (imported directly by
# apps/web/app/(app)/resume-corpus/corpus-seed-data.ts) and the interview story
# corpus (loaded by services/story_index.py, which is what resume tailoring
# retrieves evidence from). Excluding them left /app/data missing entirely, so
# the web typecheck failed to resolve its import and the story index had no
# corpus to load. The blanket rule above is aimed at apps/api/data.
!data/resume-corpus-initial.json
!data/interview-story-corpus.json
**/browser_profile/
**/chrome-profile/
**/sessions/
**/storage-state*.json
apps/web/e2e/.auth/
apps/extension/db.json
apps/web/public/resumes/
*.pem
*.key

# ── Dependencies and build output (reinstalled in the image) ───────────────
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
apps/api/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/out/
packages/*/dist/
apps/extension/dist/
apps/extension/.firefox-run/

# ── Test and diagnostic artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/e2e/.artifacts/
apps/web/e2e/screenshots/
apps/web/.scratch/
scratch/
tmp/
**/screenshots/
**/traces/
**/tailored_resumes/

# ── Repo noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/.DS_Store
*.log
docs/screenshots/
career-os-repairs/
kiro_*
*.md
!README.md
